==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Kamen Rider Cat (Rare Cat)|Kamen Rider Cat]], [[Cat Godzilla (Rare Cat)|Cat Godzilla]], [[Evangelion Cat (Rare Cat)|Evangelion Cat]] and [[Ultraman Cat (Rare Cat)|Ultraman Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level can be a challenge because of the number of enemies here, though these enemies should be weak enough that [[Kamen Rider Cat (Rare Cat)|Kamen Rider Cat]] can handle them all the same. While a high enough level should be enough for Kamen Rider Cat, [[Cat Combo]]s are still an option if needed. Additionally, as the One Horn, Sir Seals, and Pigge spam all occur upon base-hit, the player should have time to build up money and a stack of Kamen Rider Cats.

